{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T15:55:56+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-23T15:55:56+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"AIXTRON SE","sector":"Technology","industry":"Semiconductor Equipment & Materials","country":"Germany","city":"Herzogenrath","website":"https://www.aixtron.com","employees":1035,"summary":"AIXTRON SE, together with its subsidiaries, manufactures and sells deposition equipment to the semiconductor industry in Asia, Europe, and the United States. The company offers G10-SiC, G10-GaN, G10-AsP, AIX G5+ C, Closed Coupled Showerhead systems for research and development, AIX 2800G4-TM, and AIX G5 WW C. It also develops, produces, and installs equipment for the deposition of semiconductor materials; and offers deposition processes, consulting, training, customer support, and other related services, as well as peripheral equipment and services to support the operation of its systems. In addition, the company engages in supplying deposition equipment for volume production; and research and development and pre-series production activities. Its products are used in laser, LED, display technologies, optical data transmission, SiC and GaN power electronics, and other applications. AIXTRON SE was founded in 1983 and is headquartered in Herzogenrath, Germany.","exchange":"XETRA","currency":"EUR","financial_currency":"EUR","summary_fr":"AIXTRON SE, avec ses filiales, fabrique et vend des équipements de dépôt à l'industrie des semi-conducteurs en Asie, en Europe et aux États-Unis. La société propose des systèmes de douchette à couplage fermé G10-SiC, G10-GaN, G10-AsP, AIX G5+ C, AIX 2800G4-TM et AIX G5 WW C. Il développe, produit et installe également des équipements pour le dépôt de matériaux semi-conducteurs; et offre des processus de dépôt, des services de conseil, de formation, de soutien à la clientèle et d'autres services connexes, ainsi que des équipemen